# 電子手帳 (design 11.23), for tools/ui_run.py: the sample 私の手帳 opened in
# its three windows (予定表 at 100,70, its work area from 110,98; カレンダー
# at 528,70, from 538,98; 住所録 at 528,338, from 538,366). The カレンダー's
# months and a date pressed; the 検索パネル (right of the カレンダー, its
# work area from 834,98) finding 19:00 in the 予定表, then てにす (テニス,
# the kana either way) and fax:7778 (a field named) in the 住所録; a row
# typed through かな漢字変換, letters carried from one row to another and
# through the tray; the index list; a page added from the ページ menu and its
# よみ typed, sorted at once; 印刷 of the person shown; 用紙設定; the
# カレンダー put away and shown again from the 表示 menu; a day made empty
# and a page deleted; saved, closed and opened again. Then the template
# 手帳用紙, with its one empty page and the holidays in bold. Last, letters
# carried out of the 手帳 into a text of the desktop's, from one of its
# windows to another, and out of the text into the 手帳. The dates are
# those of October 2026: the カレンダー opens on the month the machine's
# clock says, and 2026/10 is chosen first from its ページ menu (年月を選択,
# the year and month typed into the panel), whatever day the test runs on.
# The menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row: ページ
# from then on.
open 01a0d8c4-53c6-7a77-8b88-9cadbecf53c6
