# letters carried between windows: from the 予定表 into the 住所録's メモ2
# (another window of the 手帳's, a move), from the 住所録 into the text
# TADjsについて behind (a move), and from the text into the 予定表 (a copy:
# the text keeps its letters), then within the text (a move). A window
# letters are dropped on comes to the front and takes the keys (design
# 10.4): after the text has taken them it covers the 住所録, so what goes
# between the 手帳's own windows is done first.
open 019a6c96-e262-7dfd-a3bc-1e85d495d60d
wait 1500
win TADjsについて
